            "id": "749360103",
            "speakerId": 5201,
            "speakerName": "Darcy",
            "text": "But ever since I arrived in the Fortress of Meropide, I've led a regular and healthy life!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "749360104"
            ]
          },
          "749360104": {
            "id": "749360104",
            "speakerId": 5201,
            "speakerName": "Darcy",
            "text": "If you have had similar issues, I recommend you stay a while longer!"
